> Using Mod_samename

> Using Mod_samename_middle

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope Test:
  output o content Mod_samename
  output l content list of Mod_samename
  output m content Mod_samename

scope Test:
  definition o equals output of Mod_samename.Mod_samename
  definition l equals [o; Mod_samename { -- r: 1 }]
  definition m equals (output of Mod_samename_middle.Mod_samename_middle).m
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope Test
┌─[RESULT]─ Test ─
│ o = Mod_samename {
│       -- r: 42
│     }
│ l = [
│       Mod_samename {
│         -- r: 42
│       };
│       Mod_samename {
│         -- r: 1
│       };
│     ]
│ m = Mod_samename {
│       -- r: 7
│     }
└─
